<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ s/adj retail sales rise 7.9 pct in April.</title>
<headline>NZ s/adj retail sales rise 7.9 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand (SNZ) on Tuesday released the following retail sales data for April.</p>
<p>Revised figures are in brackets.</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted, month-on-month:</p>
<p>    April 1997	     March 1997	     April 1996</p>
<p>    +7.9 pct		 -3.9 pct		 +0.5 pct</p>
<p>Total actual retail sales (percentage change from same month previous year):</p>
<p>    April 1997	     March 1997	     April 1996</p>
<p>     +2.9 pct		 -4.8 pct		 +7.8 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
